1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
POV: you try to sell
your index fund on a Saturday

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Order placed. And… it waits.
Till Monday.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Because markets keep office
hours. Weekdays only.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
On-chain investing works
differently.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,000
Same idea, a basket of assets,
on a ledger that never closes.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Trades settle in minutes.
Check every holding yourself.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Is it riskier? It's newer and
can swing more. Learn first.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Follow for plain-English
money stuff 🌱
